cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "KASE market data: minute-bar acquisition and board-feed provenance"
abstract: >-
  Acquisition code for a 1-minute bar store of Kazakhstan Stock Exchange (KASE)
  instruments from a retail broker's chart-data endpoint, with the seven response
  defects that corrupt a naive fetch, including a timestamp frame that a
  constant UTC offset gets wrong across Almaty's 2024 time-zone change; a daily
  companion fetcher; recorders for KASE's trade-results board; and an
  identification of that board's quote-labelled fields from a recording made
  between April and August 2026. The bars and the board recordings are not redistributed;
  data/README.md describes the sources and the derived tables that are.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Zhan
    family-names: Amankeldy
repository-code: "https://github.com/zhan-a/kase-market-data"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-30"
keywords:
  - market data
  - market microstructure
  - data provenance
  - emerging markets
  - reproducibility
